1
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:09,900
Spartan one-one-seven — Mjolnir locked, target in frame

2
00:00:09,950 --> 00:00:12,765
You burned down whole Olympus over rage you couldn't tame

3
00:00:12,814 --> 00:00:15,875
Gray beard yelling "BOY!" again — same tantrum, different mold

4
00:00:15,925 --> 00:00:18,621
Rowing boats with Mimir's head — that dad act's getting old

5
00:00:18,651 --> 00:00:21,914
Mjolnir armor eats your blades — energy shields block every blow

6
00:00:21,964 --> 00:00:24,747
My M-A-five and plasma blade lay ancient gods below

7
00:00:24,776 --> 00:00:27,934
Dropped from orbit, blew up Halo, saved humanity from doom

8
00:00:27,984 --> 00:00:32,333
You just mashed a circle button, leaving Greece inside a tomb

9
00:00:34,377 --> 00:00:37,873
Stolen at six by a lab coat — stripped of your name and soul

10
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:40,871
Locked in a green metal bucket — puppet on full control

11
00:00:40,921 --> 00:00:43,975
You lost a blue hologram — Cortana vanished in thin air

12
00:00:44,025 --> 00:00:47,106
You cloned "The Weapon" from her code like grief just needs a spare

13
00:00:47,156 --> 00:00:50,151
I butchered Olympus and broke the Nine — frost on the axe I swing

14
00:00:50,201 --> 00:00:53,009
Leviathan cracks your shield to splinters and broken rings

15
00:00:53,059 --> 00:00:56,206
A broken ring and a ten-year wait — your makers rebranded in shame

16
00:00:56,256 --> 00:01:00,061
I swept Game of the Year while Xbox gave up the console game

17
00:01:14,743 --> 00:01:18,010
Talk about puppets? Ares chained those blades right into your skin

18
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:21,155
Ashes of family baked on your chest — living proof of your sin

19
00:01:21,205 --> 00:01:24,416
You ran to Midgard to dodge your ghosts, pretending you found peace

20
00:01:24,436 --> 00:01:27,403
I'm the Spartan who holds the line — you fled from burning Greece

21
00:01:27,404 --> 00:01:30,412
I broke the chains of the gods themselves — I own the scars I bear

22
00:01:30,432 --> 00:01:33,493
You're owned by the U.N.S.C. — just hardware they repair

23
00:01:33,530 --> 00:01:36,731
Real Spartans bleed in Laconia's dust, not on a scientist's wire

24
00:01:36,781 --> 00:01:39,703
I shattered Fate and the Sisters' loom — you follow orders for hire

25
00:01:39,704 --> 00:01:46,312
No backup left, just a single round — I stood when worlds would fall

26
00:01:46,362 --> 00:01:52,144
Protector of humanity — I fought to save them all

27
00:01:52,145 --> 00:01:55,247
You guard the cage of a dying fleet, obedient to the end

28
00:01:55,289 --> 00:01:58,175
Breaker of fate and prophecy — no knee will ever bend

29
00:01:58,176 --> 00:02:01,071
Give me a weapon and point to hell — I'll finish the fight alone

30
00:02:01,111 --> 00:02:04,630
One Spartan standing for humankind — unbreakable flesh and bone

31
00:02:04,632 --> 00:02:07,773
Your fight is over, tin soldier — Chaos burns through your core

32
00:02:07,823 --> 00:02:10,897
Only one Spartan claims the crown — bow to the God of War!

